# Text shapes that must never reach the public GitHub copy of this repo.
# Read by scripts/check-never-public.sh: one extended regex per line, matched case-insensitively.
# Specific names (employers and the like) live in .claude/never-public.txt, which is itself
# kept off the public copy, so this file only holds generic shapes.

# A Tailscale machine name, e.g. some-host.tail1234ab.ts.net
[a-z0-9-]+\.tail[0-9a-f]{4,}\.ts\.net
# A Tailscale IPv4 address (100.64.0.0/10)
(^|[^0-9.])100\.(6[4-9]|[7-9][0-9]|1[01][0-9]|12[0-7])\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}($|[^0-9])
# A Tailscale IPv6 address
fd7a:115c:a1e0:
